<p class="not-first:mt-[1.5em] leading-[1.65em] text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-200">Each item in the returned array contains an encrypted <code class="nextra-code" dir="ltr">resource_payload</code> blob and the <code class="nextra-code" dir="ltr">transaction_hash</code> of the transaction that created it.</p>
<h2 id="decrypting-resources" class="x:tracking-tight x:text-slate-900 x:dark:text-slate-100 x:font-semibold x:target:animate-[fade-in_1.5s] x:mt-10 x:border-b x:pb-1 x:text-3xl nextra-border">Decrypting resources<a href="#decrypting-resources" class="x:focus-visible:nextra-focus subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"></a></h2>
<p class="not-first:mt-[1.5em] leading-[1.65em] text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-200">Use <code class="nextra-code" dir="ltr">parseIndexerResourceResponse</code> to decrypt the blobs using your encryption private key:</p>
